===Alternative forms===
* {{alter|ru|вокза́лъ||ru-PRO}}
* {{alt|ru|фокса́л|вокса́л|воксга́л||obsolete}}

===Etymology===
{{bor+|ru|en|Vauxhall}}, in reference to {{w|Vauxhall Gardens}} in London. The ending was influenced by {{m|ru|зал||hall}}. The spelling {{m|ru|фоксал}} attested in 1777 is from {{cog|fr|facs-hall}}, from the same English source. The transportation sense derives from an epithet for the [[:w:Pavlovsk, Saint Petersburg|Pavlovsk]] railway station building, which at one time served as both a passenger lounge and a place of entertainment.

